                                "sense_id": "e2ed8fd4-c0db-329a-9847-0591ed66927c",
                                "text": "At first the ravenous animals were startled and terrified at the change—at the cessation of movement. They shrank alarmedly back […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88f00dcd-86e3-442d-b2e8-8eb321496289",
                                "sense_id": "e2ed8fd4-c0db-329a-9847-0591ed66927c",
                                "text": "Now I thought I had said something calculated to make Bessie turn pale and gasp, but I could scarcely believe it when I looked up, expecting to find her almost fainting, and saw her pensively, but by no means alarmedly, shaking her head. \""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00958024-ec12-42ff-a8f5-40b490bc61e9",
                                "sense_id": "e2ed8fd4-c0db-329a-9847-0591ed66927c",
                                "text": "The Law and Order Party was being organized out of various elements that viewed alarmedly the Vigilantes' growing power."
                            }
